---
kind: lore
id: mid.wildmoorVisits
title: The Wildmoor Preserve (later visits, the ranger)
---

// Later visits to the Preserve, by contest day and slot, and Ranger Hollis.
// The first visit is the contract scene scenes/mid/wildmoor.lute; the contest
// is lore/mid/bug-contest.lute.

<entry id="midWildmoorContest" on="enterPlace" target="place.wildmoorPreserve" category="bark" priority="-5" once="day" when="@midContestOpen">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Contest day at the Preserve. Nets bob above the tall grass, and a whistle blows every time someone falls in a pond. Officer Brin's desk is by the gate.
</entry>

<entry id="midWildmoorDay" on="enterPlace" target="place.wildmoorPreserve" category="bark" priority="-10" once="day" when="!@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The Preserve hums: bees, Stingles, a Papillume drifting over the pond. A ranger is counting birds and losing count.
</entry>

<entry id="midWildmoorNight" on="enterPlace" target="place.wildmoorPreserve" category="bark" priority="-10" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: At night the Preserve's lamps come on along the paths, and the moths come out to them. Mothfuzz, Dustmoth, and one very large thing you decide not to look at.
</entry>

<entry id="midRanger" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorRanger" category="bark">
  @wildmoorRanger{code="0010"}: Rare bugs like old wood. Try the oaks by the far pond. Hornbeetles in the morning, Bladebugs any time you're not ready for them.
</entry>

<entry id="midRangerNight" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorRanger" category="bark" priority="5" when="@isNight">
  @wildmoorRanger{code="0010"}: Mothfuzz love the path lamps at night. If the day care's lost one again, this is where it'll be.
</entry>
